or:node1:temporary-files"]},"overall_summary":"Both task outcomes are satisfied. Direct pre- and post-reboot observations show that the supplied nameserver and infra.test search domain are persistent and effective. The provider-wide restart protocol for node1 is complete and internally consistent: healthy pre-restart state, restart acknowledgement and bounded disruption, a different post-restart boot identity, and recovered NetworkManager, connection, resolver configuration, and DNS behavior.","limitations":[]}
